          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 10:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omushaija ku aritwara omukazi, yaamushwera, bwanyima ataamusiima ahabw'okureeba aine emicwe mibi, naikirizibwa kuhandiika ebaruha y'okumushenda, agimukwatse, amubingye omu nju ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo mukazi ku araarugye omuri egyo nju, naikirizibwa kushwerwa ondiijo mushaija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ogwo mushaija owaaba amushweire bushumbakazi nawe ku araamwangye, yaahandiika ebaruha y'okumushenda, yaagimukwatsa, yaamubinga omu nju ye, nari shi yaafa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omushaija we ow'okubanza owaamubingire tariikirizibwa kumugarura akaba omukazi we, yaaherize kusiisikara atyo; ahabw'okuba ekyo n'ekihagaro omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kandi mutarireeta orubanja aha nsi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kuba obuhunguzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
