            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omuntu ku arishangwa aine ou yaibire weena omuri beene waabo Abaisraeli, naamutwaza nk'omuhuuku, nari yaamutunda, ogwo mushuma aryaitwa; ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuriimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.7",
