        {
          "text": "kureka oryaguma oijukye ku waabaire ori omuhuuku omuri Misri, kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku yaakucungwire, akakwihayo; nikyo ndikukuzibirira kutwaza otyo. ",
