              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku oriteera omuti gwawe gw'omuzeituuni kwihamu ebijuma, otarigaruka omu mataagi gaagwo; ebiritsigaramu biryaba eby'omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
